5,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. To make sure we choose a vendor that actually lasts, I'd like to look into support ownership during last winter's outage and warehouse rule changes after new accounts.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree we need a practical approach. I will look into the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover, as well as yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm interested in the long-term health of our tools. I'll check the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I want to understand the human element. I'll look into administrator retirements and hiring times, and depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A very thorough start. I shall investigate the board minutes on capital and operating requests and the five years of renewal invoices to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
